  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/veteerav" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n310.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:regalim/musaf/text/veteerav"/>May our entreaty be pleasing to Thee like the whole-offering and the sacrifice. O Merciful One, restore Thy presence to Zion in Thy great mercies and the order of worship to Jerusalem. Let our eyes behold Thy return to Zion in compassion and let us serve Thee there in awe as in olden times and former years. <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:regalim/musaf/text/sheotekha"/>Blessed art Thou, O Lord, whom alone we wish to worship in awe. <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
